# VSP Phone v4 — permissions address table
# Format for address_file mode: <group_id> <ip> <mask> [port] [proto] [pattern] [contextInfo]
#
# group 1 = trusted internal Docker network sources (lab)
# group 2 = Telnyx SIP signaling PoPs (Phase 8 IP authentication)
#
# NestJS still owns call authorization (ADR-024). Kamailio ACL is edge gate only.
# Refresh PoP ranges from https://sip.telnyx.com published IPs in production.

1 172.16.0.0 12 any any
1 192.168.0.0 16 any any
1 10.0.0.0 8 any any
1 127.0.0.1 32 any any

# Telnyx signaling — published edge samples (expand in ops). Lab also trusts group 1.
2 192.76.120.0 24 5060 udp telnyx_pop
2 64.16.250.0 24 5060 udp telnyx_pop
2 185.246.41.0 24 5060 udp telnyx_eu
2 185.246.48.0 22 5060 udp telnyx_pop
2 103.115.244.0 24 5060 udp telnyx_apac
2 192.76.120.0 24 5061 tcp telnyx_pop
2 64.16.250.0 24 5061 tcp telnyx_pop
2 185.246.41.0 24 5061 tcp telnyx_eu
